From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: musa <musa@local>
Date: Tue, 01 Jul 2026 17:30:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] MUSA(csrc): compile the libtorch_stable scaled fp8/int8 quant
 kernels on mcc

Normalize the relocated scaled-quant kernels' includes so they build under the
MUSA porter's per-file _musa tree (same idiom as the layernorm-quant kernels),
and route the int8 rounding helpers off the NVIDIA-only PTX path:

- common.cu (fp8) and scaled_quant.cu (int8): the ".." relative parents do not
  resolve after the porter relocates each file. Route the regular-tree parents
  (fp8/common.cuh, cub_helpers.h) through the vllm/csrc include root and the
  stable-tree headers (dispatch_utils.h/torch_utils.h -- they carry the
  VLLM_STABLE_DISPATCH_* macros and get_current_cuda_stream) through
  libtorch_stable/. Route vectorization_utils through libtorch_stable/ so its
  vec_n_t/q8_n_t coalesce with the copy pulled transitively by fp8/common.cuh
  (a path-based "#pragma once" would not dedupe two ported-tree copies ->
  redefinition on mcc).
- scaled_quant.cu float_to_int8_rn / float_to_int32_rn / int32_to_int8: mcc
  cannot assemble the NVIDIA-only `cvt.rni.sat.*` inline PTX (it emits wrong
  int8s), so take the portable std::nearbyint + saturate path that ROCm already
  uses -- guard the ROCm branches with `|| defined(USE_MUSA)`.

These kernels define dynamic_scaled_fp8_quant, dynamic_per_token_scaled_fp8_quant
and the static/dynamic int8 quant ops (all Tensor-arg, boxable), plus
static_scaled_fp8_quant (kept CUDA-only -- its int[] group_shape is unboxable).

---
diff --git a/csrc/libtorch_stable/quantization/w8a8/fp8/common.cu b/csrc/libtorch_stable/quantization/w8a8/fp8/common.cu
index d02fc2296..ee1860840 100644
--- a/csrc/libtorch_stable/quantization/w8a8/fp8/common.cu
+++ b/csrc/libtorch_stable/quantization/w8a8/fp8/common.cu
@@ -1,8 +1,15 @@
-#include "../../../../quantization/w8a8/fp8/common.cuh"
-#include "../../../dispatch_utils.h"
-#include "../../../../cub_helpers.h"
-#include "../../vectorization_utils.cuh"
-#include "../../../torch_utils.h"
+// MUSA: the porter emits this file into a per-file _musa tree; route the
+// regular-tree parents through the csrc include root and keep the stable-tree
+// headers (dispatch_utils.h/torch_utils.h provide the VLLM_STABLE_DISPATCH_*
+// macros + get_current_cuda_stream) via libtorch_stable/. vectorization_utils
+// goes through libtorch_stable/ so its vec_n_t/q8_n_t coalesce with the copy
+// pulled transitively by fp8/common.cuh (a path-based "#pragma once" would not
+// dedupe two ported-tree copies -> redefinition on mcc).
+#include "quantization/w8a8/fp8/common.cuh"
+#include "libtorch_stable/dispatch_utils.h"
+#include "cub_helpers.h"
+#include "libtorch_stable/quantization/vectorization_utils.cuh"
+#include "libtorch_stable/torch_utils.h"
 #include <torch/csrc/stable/macros.h>
 namespace vllm {
 
